,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體、並稱、匿名者、校勘或尚未定指代；不補姓名、親屬、闕代或成員。"},{"id":"c-shiji-037-wei:m054-0037","start":37,"end":39,"surface":"石碏","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001545","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-037-wei:m054-0050","start":50,"end":52,"surface":"宣縱","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體、並稱、匿名者、校勘或尚未定指代；不補姓名、親屬、闕代或成員。"},{"id":"c-shiji-037-wei:m054-0057","start":57,"end":58,"surface":"伋","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001553","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-037-wei:m054-0059","start":59,"end":60,"surface":"朔","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001557","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-037-wei:m054-0061","start":61,"end":63,"surface":"蒯聵","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001585","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-037-wei:m054-0066","start":66,"end":68,"surface":"出公","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001586","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-037-wei:m054-0078","start":78,"end":80,"surface":"君角","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000540","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-037-wei","book_id":"b-shiji-037","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-037-wei"},{"id":"c-shiji-047-kong:p037","text":"夏，衞靈公卒，立孫輒，是為衞出公。六月，趙鞅內太子蒯聵于戚。陽虎使太子絻，八人衰絰，偽自衞迎者，哭而入，遂居焉。冬，蔡遷于州來。是歲魯哀公三年，而孔子年六十矣。齊助衞圍戚，以衞太子蒯聵在故也。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-047-kong:m037-0002","start":2,"end":5,"surface":"衞靈公","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002873","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-047-kong:m037-0008","start":8,"end":10,"surface":"孫輒","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002889","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-047-kong:m037-0013","start":13,"end":16,"surface":"衞出公","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002889","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-047-kong:m037-0020","start":20,"end":22,"surface":"趙鞅","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002904","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-047-kong:m037-0023","start":23,"end":27,"surface":"太子蒯聵","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002890","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-047-kong:m037-0030","start":30,"end":32,"surface":"陽虎","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002853","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-047-kong:m037-0033","start":33,"end":35,"surface":"太子","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002890","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-047-kong:m037-0037","start":37,"end":39,"surface":"八人","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體、神怪、對話、廟稱合稱或親屬指代待核，不補姓名、成員及闕代。"},{"id":"c-shiji-047-kong:m037-0045","start":45,"end":47,"surface":"迎者","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體、神怪、對話、廟稱合稱或親屬指代待核，不補姓名、成員及闕代。"},{"id":"c-shiji-047-kong:m037-0066","start":66,"end":69,"surface":"魯哀公","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002891","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-047-kong:m037-0073","start":73,"end":75,"surface":"孔子","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002851","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-047-kong:m037-0087","start":87,"end":92,"surface":"衞太子蒯聵","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002890","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-047-kong","book_id":"b-shiji-047","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-047-kong"},{"id":"c-shiji-047-kong:p054","text":"孔子曰：「魯衞之政，兄弟也。」是時，衞君輒父不得立，在外，諸侯數以為讓。而孔子弟子多仕於衞，衞君欲得孔子為政。子路曰：「衞君待子而為政，子將奚先？」孔子曰：「必也正名乎！」子路曰：「有是哉，子之迂也！何其正也？」孔子曰：「野哉由也！夫名不正則言不順，言不順則事不成，事不成則禮樂不興，禮樂不興則刑罰不中，刑罰不中則民無所錯手足矣。夫君子為之必可名，言之必可行。君子於其言，無所苟而已矣。」","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-047-kong:m054-0000","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"孔子","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002851","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-047-kong:m054-0018","start":18,"end":21,"surface":"衞君輒","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002889","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id"